-- The user-owned database, and it is deliberately empty.
--
-- Everything the app reads about Pokemon lives in the generated, read-only pokedex.db, which is
-- replaced whole-file and needs no migrations. This database holds only what the user creates --
-- favourites, saved teams, the remembered game, settings -- and none of that exists yet.
--
-- It is declared now rather than later because the driver, the Koin module and the migration
-- verification are all wired around it, and a schema with no tables keeps that path compiling and
-- checked instead of leaving it to be rebuilt from memory when the first table lands.
